restrictions:
  - "REQUIRES FULL BIONIC CONVERSION into one Warlord''s Shocktrooper design. Once it is performed there is no hope of ever becoming human again."
  - "Attribute requirements: none. An M.E. of 12 or higher and a good I.Q. (9+) are suggested; all that is required is a human in good mental health with the spirit to fight who believes being a Man Machine is a good thing."
  - "A Shocktrooper must have served a Warlord for several years. About 80% stay in that service for life, about 15% leave on good terms and keep their old loyalties, and about 5% leave under suspicion or as deserters and are hunted by their old camp."
  - "Each design is built only for its own Warlord''s Camp and is never sold or copied: Tempest (Alekseyevna), Butcher and Ripper (Burgasov), White Tiger (Kolodenko), Holocaust and Aftermath (Orloff), Avenging Angel (Romanov), Assassin and Mantis (Seriyev), Demonfist (Sokolov)."
  - "THE BODY IS A VESSEL ROW, one per variant: tempest-cyborg-shocktrooper, butcher-cyborg-shocktrooper, ripper-cyborg-shocktrooper, white-tiger-cyborg-shocktrooper, holocaust-cyborg-shocktrooper, aftermath-cyborg-shocktrooper, avenging-angel-cyborg-shocktrooper, assassin-cyborg-shocktrooper, mantis-cyborg-shocktrooper and demonfist-cyborg-shocktrooper. Each carries the M.D.C. by location, speeds, weapon systems and Warlord cost."
